Platform operator → restaurant group → restaurant workspace → branch/location → staff membership.

An independent restaurant can use one workspace. A restaurant group can manage several branches while retaining branch-specific records and consolidated reports.

Each organization must have isolated data, permissions, billing, usage quotas, and integrations.

